  "title": "MySQL: Complete dissection of zlib compressed",
  "description": "Issue: #10342 \n\nWhen compression is active as set by protocol flags during the handshake there is a compression header with the compressed and uncompressed length. If the uncompressed length is 0 then the packet isn't actually compressed.\n\nThis MR handles zlib compressed packets and uncompressed packets when compression is active.",
